{"id":"baile","lemma":"baile","pos":"noun","rank":717,"glosses":["dance (a sequence of rhythmic steps or movements usually performed to music)","dance (a social gathering where dancing is the main activity)","ball (a formal dance)"],"ipa":"/ˈbaile/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bailes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-baile.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Me concedes este baile?","en":"May I have this dance?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460540"},{"text":"Se esperará que bailes con Tom.","en":"You'll be expected to dance with Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802546"},{"text":"Voy a ir al baile.","en":"I'm going to the dance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604799"},{"text":"Él conoce muchos bailes folclóricos.","en":"He knows many folk dances."},{"text":"He estado tomando clases de baile.","en":"I've been taking dancing lessons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551284"}]}